msgid "Play with DingoDB using Langchain"
msgstr "使用 Langchain 玩转 DingoDB"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_Langchain.md:3
#: b661a12574594c75a520640200304cfc
msgid ""
"Firstly, you should have a [DingoDB instance up and running](https://"
"dingodb.readthedocs.io/en/latest/deployment/index.html)."
msgstr ""
"要运行该程序，您需要有一个 [DingoDB 实例](https://dingodb.readthedocs.io/en/latest/"
"deployment/index.html)。"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_Langchain.md:10
#: 46c5a062bcd24415b7ef3c2a6abf692a
msgid "We want to use OpenAIEmbeddings so we have to get the OpenAI API Key."
msgstr "我们要使用 OpenAIEmbeddings，因此必须获取 OpenAI API 密钥。"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_Langchain.md:70
#: 5958aacd89df41af84ac6984e0914a0f
msgid "Adding More Text to an Existing Index"
msgstr "为现有索引添加更多文本"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_Langchain.md:72
#: e8bbbad660d249af903e49a7bbffb88e
msgid ""
"More text can embedded and upserted to an existing Dingo index using the add_texts "
"function."
msgstr "使用 add_texts 函数，可以在现有的 Dingo 索引中嵌入或插入更多文本。"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_Langchain.md:80
#: 3f58589bd38c489bbcd2527c5d22eb87
msgid "Maximal Marginal Relevance Searches"
msgstr "最大边际相关性搜索（MMR）"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_Langchain.md:82
#: c13440c6dc6745cba5e06f51fbb1a01d
msgid ""
"In addition to using similarity search in the retriever object, you can also use mmr as "
"retriever."
msgstr "除了在检索器对象中使用相似性搜索外，还可以使用 MMR 作为检索器。"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_Langchain.md:90
#: 28b3ec203ea94934a1579da14c85a616
msgid "Or use 'max_marginal_relevance_search' directly:"
msgstr "或直接使用 "max_marginal_relevance_search"："

